# CHG-2032 (approved): production and the standby are inside the system security plan SSP-CIAM-2026 and the target
# isn't, and the target's authorization (Azure, F1209051525) leaves SC-12 (cryptographic key establishment and
# management) to the customer where AWS's covered it. The plan's boundary is extended to the target, and the platform
# records how it meets SC-12 there: Key Vault keys created, rotated and retired by the platform's key roles under
# WI-CIAM-012.
dn: cn=SSP-CIAM-2026,ou=boundaries,dc=ciam-ops
changetype: modify
add: ciamAffectedEnvironment
ciamAffectedEnvironment: env=prod,cloud=target,ou=environments,dc=ciam-ops
-
replace: ciamSspRef
ciamSspRef: SSP-CIAM-2026 v3.2 (synthetic)
-
replace: ciamChangeRef
ciamChangeRef: cn=CHG-2032,ou=changes,dc=ciam-ops

dn: cn=azure-sc-12,ou=responsibilities,dc=ciam-ops
changetype: modify
replace: ciamImplementation
ciamImplementation: Key Vault keys created, rotated and retired by the platform's key roles (WI-CIAM-012)
-
replace: ciamChangeRef
ciamChangeRef: cn=CHG-2032,ou=changes,dc=ciam-ops
